qTltzZ0isnvUvh-MHee7OKwmoId8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR3UCcKnCG5HFKlar8rhfE77EwVQAzCZjsjDKxGBQkKnA&oe=6AFC75DA"}, {"file_name": "ub (4).png", "id": "4526818064299727", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_4526818067633060_7711340867508690256_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QC0LmqeV_gcQ7kNvwHnMtUS&_nc_oc=AdrwMTcOaU6K-4zeEdSn3W1WA_SYdOBbiXAObh6-0AcW79RdPtqtMlafeIT9mzFVQKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRyn5wujT7Q90tjy8wv9sAfxQshTt1vZ_DhNhnKveK1g&oe=6AFC71E3"}, {"file_name": "ub (5).png", "id": "1827159951618906", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307444_1827159954952239_6264049030012203255_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KYdbrrpSW2YQ7kNvwHaqJQi&_nc_oc=AdpnshMWSJPHWXcjf6S-k-G7eZ0iJD6JY5yvT1TYum7mVUG60mCuJxSi3N4ImlMKyhQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR8waHxoa4p1jSkq7OthO3RS9NZA_ZYvJ3UaNUEaCvt7g&oe=6AFC63D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ultra boom xr new banner (1).png", "id": "2597079310734721", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604370996_2597079317401387_8789500534927142522_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hW9F44v4kkAQ7kNvwGF2qFk&_nc_oc=AdqOhrB1MSA_T3UjC0-5mCk56Iholv5tH9LDsDgcv5O78lq7yqmWQawrzX2PaDrCFek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRwXwF8MhvnamM0XTO6YIrDWnCJL5-V5XSVlfSCWSA7vA&oe=6AFC63DF"}, "display_name": "ULTRA BOOM XR: PHYSICS  & COMBAT SANDBOX", "keywords": ["sandbox", "physics", "combat", "shooter", "playground"], "long_description": "WELCOME TO ULTRA BOOM XR, WHERE CHAOS IS YOUR CREATION!\n\nDive into a VR physics and combat sandbox packed with explosive shootouts, destructible environments, and unpredictable ragdoll action. Grab a weapon, blast through cover, send bots flying, and invent battles your way!\n\n\ud83d\udca5 200+ WEAPONS & TOOLS\nFrom guns, grenades, and melee weapons to healing guns and adrenaline tools, experiment with wild combinations and find new ways to fight, smash, and destroy.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 60+ ENEMY BOT TYPES\nFace ranged and melee fighters with physical hit reactions, self-balancing system, ragdoll knockdowns, and get-up animations. Set up team-vs-team bot battles and watch the chaos unfold!\n\n\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f 280+ DESTRUCTIBLE OBJECTS\nBlow apart props and turn cover into debris. Fight across slums, desert markets, military bases, and mountain arenas filled with opportunities for explosive destruction!\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f CREATE YOUR OWN SANDBOX\nBuild custom battle setups with props and weapons, then save and load your creations from the custom map slots. Every new experiment is a new fight.\n\n\ud83c\udfaf PLAY YOUR WAY\nStage epic bot wars, test weapon physics, survive intense shootouts, or simply enjoy smashing everything in sight. Scoreboards, respawns, and restartable matches keep the action going.\n\nLove VR shooting games, physics sandboxes, ragdoll combat, destructible environments, and open-ended action? Ultra Boom XR puts the weapons, destruction, and freedom in your hands.\n\nLOAD UP. LET LOOSE. MAKE IT BOOM!", "short_description": "SMASH. SHOOT. EXPLODE! Ultra Boom XR is a VR physics and combat sandbox packed with 200+ weapons and tools, 60+ enemy bot types, and 280+ destructible objects! \n\nUnleash ragdoll chaos, explosive gunfights, and team-vs-team bot battles. Experiment with guns, melee weapons, grenades, and physics-driven destruction across action-packed arenas. \n\nBuild your own battles, save and reload custom maps, and take control of every fight. The ultimate VR shooter playground: your weapons, your rules!"}]}, "developer_name": "Ultra Fun Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ultrafungames.com/privacy-policy-extra/", "developer_terms_of_service_url":