: ["sandbox", "physics", "destruction", "combat", "shooter"], "long_description": "Ultra Boom XR is a massive VR physics combat sandbox built around freedom, destruction and experimentation.\n\nJump straight into a growing collection of pre-made battlefields or build your own from scratch. Fight through the Slums, battle across the Desert Market, assault Desert Bases with destructible houses, or take on the Mountain map with destructible tactical walls and defensive positions. New maps and environments are planned in future updates.\n\nCreate your own battles using 280+ props, 230+ weapons and tools, and 60+ bots and characters. Build bases, arenas, fortified positions or chaotic experiments, place opposing teams, arm them, then jump directly into the fight yourself.\n\nMany objects and structures can be damaged, broken or destroyed, letting battles reshape the environment around you.\n\nSave your creations across custom slots, load them later, modify them, destroy them and rebuild.\n\nUltra Boom XR is designed as a growing VR combat toybox with more maps, weapons, bots, props and destructible content planned.\n\nBuild the battle. Join the fight. Destroy everything!", "short_description": "Designed for VR Enthusiasts\nFull physics-driven combat\n\nRealistic object destruction\n\nOptimized for Quest 3 standalone\n\n Get ready to unleash destruction, domination, and full creative freedom \u2014 this is ULTRA BOOM XR!"}]}, "developer_name": "Ultra Fun Games", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ultrafungames.com/privacy-policy-extra/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ultra Fun Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ultrafungames.com/#hero", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040